 * 
 * @section dev_reg_class_summary Summary
 * 
 * Device registry class diagram shows class inheritance hierarchy and dependencies for the 
 * public device registration interface and device factory classes.
 * 
 * Device factory classes implement device enumeration and registration procedures for SDR 
 * devices that fall under the specific device factory classification. Enumeration procedures
 * return DeviceHandle objects, which idetify devices and provide information about connection.
 * Device registration procedures register devices under universal device control interface - 
 * ``SDRDevice``.
 * 
 * Public device enumeration and registration interface - ``DeviceRegistry`` utilizes the 
 * public device factory interface ``DeviceRegistryEntry`` to access specific device factory 
 * enumeration and registration functions to detect all supported SDR devices.
 * 
 * @subsection dev_reg_class_legend Diagram legend
 * 
 * Link definitions:
 * 
 * - Solid line with a transparet arrow head body - Inheritance
 * - Dotted line with simple arrow head - Dependency
 * 
 */